# WhisperCatchSentinel

Headless tactical SIGINT & C-UAS sensor node engineered for ARM64 edge devices. Features multi-channel P25/DMR digital trunking decryption, local Whisper voice transcription, Direct Remote ID/DJI DroneID tracking, and 5.8GHz analog FPV video interception. Integrates seamlessly with Iron Patriot mesh networks and ATAK via REST APIs.

## Current backend baseline

This repository now includes a minimal cloud-free FastAPI edge backend scaffold focused on:

- ARM64/x86 runtime-awareness for Raspberry Pi 5, Jetson Nano, and x86 deployments
- Hardware profile coverage for HackRF One, RTL-SDR V4, Alfa USB Wi-Fi monitor interface, and Sniffle BLE dongle
- Transient-safe USB detection state reporting
- Volatile crypto workspace validation by enforcing tmpfs mount checks (`/dev/shm/whispercatch`)
- REST endpoints for health/runtime state and a WebSocket spectrum feed placeholder
- ATAK Cursor-on-Target message generation and multicast utility for local tactical networks

## Run locally

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .[dev]
uvicorn whispercatch_sentinel.app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

## Test

```bash
pytest
```
